{"type":"text","timestamp":1794560040227,"sessionID":"ses_e2be4957affeeyAcLkZG48Stad","part":{"id":"prt_1d41d11cb002zFOtW58W2jnMg0","sessionID":"ses_e2be4957affeeyAcLkZG48Stad","messageID":"msg_1d41d0436001hmvtQ0IBn8dXsg","type":"text","text":"T008 is complete. Both named files changed, nothing else.\n\nFiles written:\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml` — added the exit 3 row after the exit 1 row, changed the exit 1 row to cover a dropped or `foreign:` line and the `nothing was restored` case, and added the symlinked `REPO RULES.md` or Cursor mirror to the exit 2 precondition list.\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt` — added the exit 3 sentence after the exit 1 sentence in the Failure Summary.\n\nVerify output, run from the repository root:\n\n```text\n$ rg -c \"Exit 3 means\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\n1\n$ rg -c \"foreign:\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\n1\n$ rg -c \"exits 3\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt\n1\n$ node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-agents-md-contract.test.cjs\nℹ tests 37\nℹ pass 37\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\n```\n\nThe DAE file has no exit-code table, so the \"exit 1 row\" is the `phase_4_write` activity line that begins `Exit 1 means`, and the new row is the next activity line, before the allowlist-refusal item. `git -c core.fsmonitor=false status --short` over the two paths shows only those two files modified.\n\nCould not do: nothing. I did not tick the T008 checkbox in `tasks.md`. Nothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794560037323,"end":1794560040227}}}
